(215665, 12518, 1863, '<td valign="top">YOu had to go and make me hungry! It''s a great idea and well executed, and I''m sure it was delicious! The lighting is a bit dim, and there''s a distracting glare off to the top of the shot, but it is still good. -Annida</td>', 'YOu had to go and make me hungry! It''s a great idea and well executed, and I''m sure it was delicious! The lighting is a bit dim, and there''s a distracting glare off to the top of the shot, but it is still good. -Annida', '2003-02-15 01:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
