(216058, 12469, 5044, '<td valign="top">Neat idea, but i see a few things that take away from it. The glass seems a little tilted to the right, and is not properly centered. The candle reflection is good, but I cannot make out the two reflections on the left. I also think that we see you, the photgrapher in the reflection. The background is not quite blackened enough, we notice it too much. Aside from that the colours are good and the focus is crisp.</td>', 'Neat idea, but i see a few things that take away from it. The glass seems a little tilted to the right, and is not properly centered. The candle reflection is good, but I cannot make out the two reflections on the left. I also think that we see you, the photgrapher in the reflection. The background is not quite blackened enough, we notice it too much. Aside from that the colours are good and the focus is crisp.', '2003-02-15 19:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
