(216151, 12527, 3280, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, one of my two favorites this challenge. I tried a similar shot and gave it up when I couldn''t get these results.  I''d be interested in your setup and lighting if you would e-mail me. Great colors and lighting.  Looks like a ribbon to me!</td>', 'Beautiful shot, one of my two favorites this challenge. I tried a similar shot and gave it up when I couldn''t get these results.  I''d be interested in your setup and lighting if you would e-mail me. Great colors and lighting.  Looks like a ribbon to me!', '2003-02-15 23:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
