(216162, 12495, 1829, '<td valign="top">Perfect...Excellent capture.  Weddings really bring out the ''love'' feel and you have cerainly captured it very well.  Crisp, clean, fresh and of course has that love feel to it.  Well done and gl  10 :)</td>', 'Perfect...Excellent capture.  Weddings really bring out the ''love'' feel and you have cerainly captured it very well.  Crisp, clean, fresh and of course has that love feel to it.  Well done and gl  10 :)', '2003-02-16 00:03:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(216163, 12435, 1829, '<td valign="top">Now, this is an excellent shot.  A weathered old board with a beautiful bunch of roses.  It certainly tells a story.  Composition and lighting are very well done also.  I hope this photo gets a placing.  Well done.</td>', 'Now, this is an excellent shot.  A weathered old board with a beautiful bunch of roses.  It certainly tells a story.  Composition and lighting are very well done also.  I hope this photo gets a placing.  Well done.', '2003-02-16 00:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
