(216426, 12500, 4648, '<td valign="top">I don''t know.  Is it?  With the expession on her face, I''d have to say no.  I can''t believe the expression.  If I''d just received those beautiful roses, I''d be all smiles.  Iike how clear the roses stand out, even though they are in the middle of the car.  Fantastic job of focusing.  I like how the background appears different colors depending on the tint of the windows, and no window.  Great contrast there.  Well done and deserves an 8 easily.</td>', 'I don''t know.  Is it?  With the expession on her face, I''d have to say no.  I can''t believe the expression.  If I''d just received those beautiful roses, I''d be all smiles.  Iike how clear the roses stand out, even though they are in the middle of the car.  Fantastic job of focusing.  I like how the background appears different colors depending on the tint of the windows, and no window.  Great contrast there.  Well done and deserves an 8 easily.', '2003-02-16 19:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(216428, 12544, 4648, '<td valign="top">There is so much emotion expressed in this photo - in the facial expression and in the touch.  Great job of capturing that.  Cuddos to the models also.  Love the soft focus - it''s plays a big part in the expressiveness.  A very sharp focus would have killed the emotion.  Amount of light is perfect.  Nice background.  Great job - a 10 all the way.</td>', 'There is so much emotion expressed in this photo - in the facial expression and in the touch.  Great job of capturing that.  Cuddos to the models also.  Love the soft focus - it''s plays a big part in the expressiveness.  A very sharp focus would have killed the emotion.  Amount of light is perfect.  Nice background.  Great job - a 10 all the way.', '2003-02-16 19:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
