(217364, 12500, 806, '<td valign="top">boy, she looks annoyed. she should be on cloud nine. perhaps this is too common for her to get flowers. who knows? lol<br/>anyway.. nice candid.</td>', 'boy, she looks annoyed. she should be on cloud nine. perhaps this is too common for her to get flowers. who knows? lolanyway.. nice candid.', '2003-02-17 12:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(217374, 12495, 806, '<td valign="top">How happy she is! And she sees you taking their photo, and is amused and flattered, but a bit embarrassed to.. she is hiding behind her roses. He is talking to her, but is a bit detached from the moment she is experiencing.. She is still caught up in the "we''re married.... *eeee*", and he is .. "okay. we need to move on. time to get on with the next thing."<br/> <br/>perfect exposure to catch her white dress and all the details.<br/>too bad about the snow.. but it couldn''t be helped.<br/></td>', 'How happy she is! And she sees you taking their photo, and is amused and flattered, but a bit embarrassed to.. she is hiding behind her roses. He is talking to her, but is a bit detached from the moment she is experiencing.. She is still caught up in the "we''re married.... *eeee*", and he is .. "okay. we need to move on. time to get on with the next thing." perfect exposure to catch her white dress and all the details.too bad about the snow.. but it couldn''t be helped.', '2003-02-17 12:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(217377, 12458, 806, '<td valign="top">nice tones, focus, lighting.<br/>limited interest.</td>', 'nice tones, focus, lighting.limited interest.', '2003-02-17 12:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(217380, 12523, 806, '<td valign="top">very much about love! love the expression seen thru the flared out toes! lol<br/>could be in better focus, but I like the choice of tones.</td>', 'very much about love! love the expression seen thru the flared out toes! lolcould be in better focus, but I like the choice of tones.', '2003-02-17 12:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(217387, 12466, 806, '<td valign="top">this is an interesting shot.<br/>look at her expression, and her possessive body language.<br/>look how he is detached by looking away. He could really care less, and would rather be elsewhere. but he is bound by her and cannot go. His eyes are flat, and empty. This relationship is killing him.<br/>the shadows and tones also suit the mood.<br/>______________________________<br/> <br/>LOL.. they are probably very much in love, and I am not sure if this is what you intended to portray.. but I like it very much, and it is what it says to me. :)<br/></td>', 'this is an interesting shot.look at her expression, and her possessive body language.look how he is detached by looking away. He could really care less, and would rather be elsewhere. but he is bound by her and cannot go. His eyes are flat, and empty. This relationship is killing him.the shadows and tones also suit the mood.______________________________ LOL.. they are probably very much in love, and I am not sure if this is what you intended to portray.. but I like it very much, and it is what it says to me. :)', '2003-02-17 12:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
