(217693, 12485, 6025, '<td valign="top">A great idea, but the picture is too much out of focus for my taste. If you want to do stuff like this, use a smaller aperture to capture everything sharp! ;)  (vote: 6)</td>', 'A great idea, but the picture is too much out of focus for my taste. If you want to do stuff like this, use a smaller aperture to capture everything sharp! ;)  (vote: 6)', '2003-02-17 17:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(218219, 12550, 2352, '<td valign="top">Well done!  The shot is hot, sexy, and a complement to the challenge to convey love.  The rich warm lighting tones combined with great composition and sharp focus gives the viewer a warm and fuzzy feel!  Great shot and congratulations!   10  (Clicker)</td>', 'Well done!  The shot is hot, sexy, and a complement to the challenge to convey love.  The rich warm lighting tones combined with great composition and sharp focus gives the viewer a warm and fuzzy feel!  Great shot and congratulations!   10  (Clicker)', '2003-02-17 23:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(218642, 12454, 3102, '<td valign="top">Hello Lisae... Overall I like the shot a lot.  I may have preferred a little sharper focus, personally.  At first glance, it looks like the man''s arm is your arm, which is a little disturbing until I realized how the hands are situated.</td>', 'Hello Lisae... Overall I like the shot a lot.  I may have preferred a little sharper focus, personally.  At first glance, it looks like the man''s arm is your arm, which is a little disturbing until I realized how the hands are situated.', '2003-02-18 11:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(218699, 12549, 5728, '<td valign="top">Great shot, I love this!! You have made this photo tell me a whole story. The lightening is soft and dreamy and the way the arm comes in from the top left is incredible. You can be proud of yourself on this one!</td>', 'Great shot, I love this!! You have made this photo tell me a whole story. The lightening is soft and dreamy and the way the arm comes in from the top left is incredible. You can be proud of yourself on this one!', '2003-02-18 11:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
