(219150, 12519, 3084, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image, very graphically expressive. It would be great to fully understand how you where able to create this image.</td>', 'Wonderful image, very graphically expressive. It would be great to fully understand how you where able to create this image.', '2003-02-19 12:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(219151, 12511, 3084, '<td valign="top">Fun image, very suggestive and inventive for the theme</td>', 'Fun image, very suggestive and inventive for the theme', '2003-02-19 12:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(219167, 12546, 1041, '<td valign="top">Challenge met.  I like the positioning of the heart within the photo, and the border works well with it.  So does the title, it really does look like it''s glowing :)  The lighting is a little uneven, the container seems to disappear a little on the right, I don''t know whether that was intentional or not, but I''d like to see this also with even lighting.  Not sure which I would like better though.</td>', 'Challenge met.  I like the positioning of the heart within the photo, and the border works well with it.  So does the title, it really does look like it''s glowing :)  The lighting is a little uneven, the container seems to disappear a little on the right, I don''t know whether that was intentional or not, but I''d like to see this also with even lighting.  Not sure which I would like better though.', '2003-02-19 12:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(219170, 12544, 1041, '<td valign="top">Challenge definitely met.  I like the obvious tenderness displayed by this photo.  She''s leaning a little against the hand and has her eye closed, the hand seems to touch her just lightly, again, tenderness.  Very nice.  I think the ribbon in her hair is a touch distracting.  Technically, I''d like to see some softer lighting and just a tad sharper focus, especially on the hand.  Emotionally a great photo, technically not bad, but areas for improvement.</td>', 'Challenge definitely met.  I like the obvious tenderness displayed by this photo.  She''s leaning a little against the hand and has her eye closed, the hand seems to touch her just lightly, again, tenderness.  Very nice.  I think the ribbon in her hair is a touch distracting.  Technically, I''d like to see some softer lighting and just a tad sharper focus, especially on the hand.  Emotionally a great photo, technically not bad, but areas for improvement.', '2003-02-19 12:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(219171, 12543, 1041, '<td valign="top">Challenge met.  Not the kind of love I had in mind when considering photos, but definitely a valid interpretation.  Nice composition.  The grid in the background actually makes it less distracting and the way the kid has it''s head turned back to Ronald is just too funny.  You can still see the grin on his face, too.  Nice and colorful overall.</td>', 'Challenge met.  Not the kind of love I had in mind when considering photos, but definitely a valid interpretation.  Nice composition.  The grid in the background actually makes it less distracting and the way the kid has it''s head turned back to Ronald is just too funny.  You can still see the grin on his face, too.  Nice and colorful overall.', '2003-02-19 12:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(219172, 12487, 1041, '<td valign="top">To me, this is a bit of a stretch for the challenge, love wouldn''t necessarily have come to my mind w/out the title.  But I can see where you were going, so I''ll accept that.  Composition-wise this is a good shot, the two trees are definitely the focus, and the mountain in the background gives the photo balance.  I''m not sure about your choice of coloring.  What did the original look like?  How would it worked in simple b&amp;w?  I''d be curious to see those, maybe you''ll post links after the voting is over.</td>', 'To me, this is a bit of a stretch for the challenge, love wouldn''t necessarily have come to my mind w/out the title.  But I can see where you were going, so I''ll accept that.  Composition-wise this is a good shot, the two trees are definitely the focus, and the mountain in the background gives the photo balance.  I''m not sure about your choice of coloring.  What did the original look like?  How would it worked in simple b&w?  I''d be curious to see those, maybe you''ll post links after the voting is over.', '2003-02-19 12:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(219176, 12495, 1041, '<td valign="top">What a perfect entry for love ... wonderful dress, wonderful pose ... but she''s got the flowers in front of her head and they are not looking at each other!  Those two things probably would''ve made this the winning image for me, but they do hurt the photo some by not being there, sorry.  I hope you took more photos that day.  :)</td>', 'What a perfect entry for love ... wonderful dress, wonderful pose ... but she''s got the flowers in front of her head and they are not looking at each other!  Those two things probably would''ve made this the winning image for me, but they do hurt the photo some by not being there, sorry.  I hope you took more photos that day.  :)', '2003-02-19 13:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(219177, 12536, 1041, '<td valign="top">You made me smile with this one, what a funny idea, and perfect title to match :)  Nicely arranged, just a little hot on the gray sleeve, and I would''ve used a flat background (or even just pulled the curtain in the background straight) to separate the object from the background further.  Border works well, too.</td>', 'You made me smile with this one, what a funny idea, and perfect title to match :)  Nicely arranged, just a little hot on the gray sleeve, and I would''ve used a flat background (or even just pulled the curtain in the background straight) to separate the object from the background further.  Border works well, too.', '2003-02-19 13:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(219180, 12482, 1041, '<td valign="top">I have to admit that "Love" does not come to mind when looking at this photo w/out the title, but I can see where you are going.  Overall, the photo has some potential, but also some flaws that give it a "snapshot" kind of feel.  I like how the girls are lined up in a row that flows diagonally through the photo.  I like that most of them are wearing read which emphasizes the diagonal.  Overall, the photo isn''t quite as sharp as it needs to be and seems al ittle washed out.  The first girl has a table behind her head that''s distracting.  A slightly different angle could''ve taken care of that.</td>', 'I have to admit that "Love" does not come to mind when looking at this photo w/out the title, but I can see where you are going.  Overall, the photo has some potential, but also some flaws that give it a "snapshot" kind of feel.  I like how the girls are lined up in a row that flows diagonally through the photo.  I like that most of them are wearing read which emphasizes the diagonal.  Overall, the photo isn''t quite as sharp as it needs to be and seems al ittle washed out.  The first girl has a table behind her head that''s distracting.  A slightly different angle could''ve taken care of that.', '2003-02-19 13:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(219181, 12527, 1041, '<td valign="top">Challenge met.  I would''ve never thought of arranging the three rings with those ribbons, but that turned out very well.  Need to add that to my list of things to remember for future photo ideas!  You''ve got nice focus and controlled the reflections on the jewellery pretty well.  While I admire the gradiant background you''ve achieved, I don''t think it adds anything to the photo.  Have you considered cropping down to the red ribbon (maybe just crop a bit off its highest point on the left).  The borders work well here, overall a very good entry for this challenge.</td>', 'Challenge met.  I would''ve never thought of arranging the three rings with those ribbons, but that turned out very well.  Need to add that to my list of things to remember for future photo ideas!  You''ve got nice focus and controlled the reflections on the jewellery pretty well.  While I admire the gradiant background you''ve achieved, I don''t think it adds anything to the photo.  Have you considered cropping down to the red ribbon (maybe just crop a bit off its highest point on the left).  The borders work well here, overall a very good entry for this challenge.', '2003-02-19 13:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(219184, 12519, 1041, '<td valign="top">Challenge met.  I bet you are getting comments about this not being a digital art website ... but I like your entry.  The lips are placed well in the frame, and I like the different shades of reds and pinks.  The white background is so difficult to achieve and you did it well.  The red border just rounds things of nicely.  I don''t know what I would''ve done differently :)</td>', 'Challenge met.  I bet you are getting comments about this not being a digital art website ... but I like your entry.  The lips are placed well in the frame, and I like the different shades of reds and pinks.  The white background is so difficult to achieve and you did it well.  The red border just rounds things of nicely.  I don''t know what I would''ve done differently :)', '2003-02-19 13:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(219185, 12526, 1041, '<td valign="top">MMMMMMMM... my favorite chocolates.  That alone should give you extra points. ;)  I like the composition, the chocolates and the rose are cropped, the rose has a beautiful tone of red.  I am wondering whether you took this photo too close up though, because it doesn''t seem quite focused, and focus gets better towards the back.</td>', 'MMMMMMMM... my favorite chocolates.  That alone should give you extra points. ;)  I like the composition, the chocolates and the rose are cropped, the rose has a beautiful tone of red.  I am wondering whether you took this photo too close up though, because it doesn''t seem quite focused, and focus gets better towards the back.', '2003-02-19 13:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(219276, 12495, 2764, '<td valign="top">Lovelyy - take the flowers out of her face.</td>', 'Lovelyy - take the flowers out of her face.', '2003-02-19 15:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(219310, 12455, 2764, '<td valign="top">Use the whole 640 pixel width.  And share the fuge with me.</td>', 'Use the whole 640 pixel width.  And share the fuge with me.', '2003-02-19 15:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(219312, 12519, 2764, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot, it feels a little crowded at the bottom. 9</td>', 'I like this a lot, it feels a little crowded at the bottom. 9', '2003-02-19 15:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(219316, 12542, 2764, '<td valign="top">digital mold on her finger ruins a nice shot.</td>', 'digital mold on her finger ruins a nice shot.', '2003-02-19 15:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(219321, 12518, 1041, '<td valign="top">What a cute idea.  Definitely meets the challenge.  Nice that you arranged this diagonally.  I can''t make up my mind whether I like the stove rings or not.  The longer I look at this, the more I think I do.  :)  The only thing is the lighting, it''s much lighter toward the back and there''s a hotspot reflection on the baking sheet. But the pizza looks soooo yummy :)</td>', 'What a cute idea.  Definitely meets the challenge.  Nice that you arranged this diagonally.  I can''t make up my mind whether I like the stove rings or not.  The longer I look at this, the more I think I do.  :)  The only thing is the lighting, it''s much lighter toward the back and there''s a hotspot reflection on the baking sheet. But the pizza looks soooo yummy :)', '2003-02-19 15:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(219322, 12446, 2764, '<td valign="top">I love this - wish the pencil had been sharper</td>', 'I love this - wish the pencil had been sharper', '2003-02-19 15:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(219325, 12550, 2764, '<td valign="top">ooh- crop out the hands and the table and leave the two glasses and the flames.  great set up but too much is going on</td>', 'ooh- crop out the hands and the table and leave the two glasses and the flames.  great set up but too much is going on', '2003-02-19 15:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(219400, 12523, 5982, '<td valign="top">ha ha ha!  This is so great!</td>', 'ha ha ha!  This is so great!', '2003-02-19 17:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(219583, 12536, 6711, '<td valign="top">cool one, clever. Molt be, noi!</td>', 'cool one, clever. Molt be, noi!', '2003-02-19 21:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(219642, 12495, 811, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot.  Great exposure, lighting, capture of the moment.  Any couple would be happy to have this one, I think.  Only one minor nit-pick, if the bouquet had been higher to hide both faces (like for privacy) or lower to show both faces, this shot would have been perfect.  Still a 10, in my opinion.</td>', 'Wonderful shot.  Great exposure, lighting, capture of the moment.  Any couple would be happy to have this one, I think.  Only one minor nit-pick, if the bouquet had been higher to hide both faces (like for privacy) or lower to show both faces, this shot would have been perfect.  Still a 10, in my opinion.', '2003-02-19 22:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(219644, 12550, 811, '<td valign="top">Wonderful exposure and lighting.  Very well done!!</td>', 'Wonderful exposure and lighting.  Very well done!!', '2003-02-19 22:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(219645, 12535, 811, '<td valign="top">I love the simplicity of the gray, white and red here.  Excellent contrast, I think, maybe needs jsut a touch of light on the left, but still very well done.</td>', 'I love the simplicity of the gray, white and red here.  Excellent contrast, I think, maybe needs jsut a touch of light on the left, but still very well done.', '2003-02-19 23:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(219647, 12527, 811, '<td valign="top">The rings are awesome, but the ribbons make this shot, I think.  They add to the composition by giving it some color, texture, and movement.  Great work</td>', 'The rings are awesome, but the ribbons make this shot, I think.  They add to the composition by giving it some color, texture, and movement.  Great work', '2003-02-19 23:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(219648, 12469, 811, '<td valign="top">Good focus and lighting.</td>', 'Good focus and lighting.', '2003-02-19 23:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(219650, 12514, 811, '<td valign="top">hehehe.  Good use of humor.  Though I like the simplicity of the red and white, I think a different color background (black maybe) might have been more effective because though it almost ties all the reds together, it does seem to make them clash some.  Great work though.</td>', 'hehehe.  Good use of humor.  Though I like the simplicity of the red and white, I think a different color background (black maybe) might have been more effective because though it almost ties all the reds together, it does seem to make them clash some.  Great work though.', '2003-02-19 23:06:52.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(219651, 12455, 811, '<td valign="top">A good idea, but you really needed a little more light.  Also, the angle that you have taken this from makes it look flat.  Maybe if you had taken a bite out of it and lowered the camera angle, it would be more dynamic and not quite so static.</td>', 'A good idea, but you really needed a little more light.  Also, the angle that you have taken this from makes it look flat.  Maybe if you had taken a bite out of it and lowered the camera angle, it would be more dynamic and not quite so static.', '2003-02-19 23:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(219652, 12482, 811, '<td valign="top">Great, natural capture of the little girl''s face  It is a little blurry, so I suspect a slightly faster shutter or ISO might help, if possible.  If not, back  up, put a tissue of the flash, and use it.</td>', 'Great, natural capture of the little girl''s face  It is a little blurry, so I suspect a slightly faster shutter or ISO might help, if possible.  If not, back  up, put a tissue of the flash, and use it.', '2003-02-19 23:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(219653, 12534, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of hte colors.  The bad thing about these hearts is that even though they are focused, they always look fuzzy.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of hte colors.  The bad thing about these hearts is that even though they are focused, they always look fuzzy.', '2003-02-19 23:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(219655, 12458, 811, '<td valign="top">too too funny.  Good focus and composition.  You ahve filled the frame well.</td>', 'too too funny.  Good focus and composition.  You ahve filled the frame well.', '2003-02-19 23:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(219656, 12509, 811, '<td valign="top">There is something about this shot I really like.  Even though it is busy, there still seems to be an obvious focal point.  And I like the bright colors.  Nice work.</td>', 'There is something about this shot I really like.  Even though it is busy, there still seems to be an obvious focal point.  And I like the bright colors.  Nice work.', '2003-02-19 23:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(219658, 12508, 811, '<td valign="top">They love you in their own special way.  Good composition.  I wish the top left of the cat had been as in focus as the foreground.  I almost feel like the pillow (?) vies for attention because of that.  I like this in bw.</td>', 'They love you in their own special way.  Good composition.  I wish the top left of the cat had been as in focus as the foreground.  I almost feel like the pillow (?) vies for attention because of that.  I like this in bw.', '2003-02-19 23:12:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(219976, 12430, 1041, '<td valign="top">Challenge met.  Nice colorfult shot.  I like how you''ve filled the whole frame with the little candy hearts as if they are going on forever.  Nice DOF, too.</td>', 'Challenge met.  Nice colorfult shot.  I like how you''ve filled the whole frame with the little candy hearts as if they are going on forever.  Nice DOF, too.', '2003-02-20 12:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(219978, 12535, 1041, '<td valign="top">Challenge met.  I like how you saturated everything but red and then repeated the red in the border.  Works well.  The flowers look a little sad, maybe that''s because they are dried (?) or just because they are lying down.  The teddy with the heart and bow-tie and red nose is just too cute.  A little reflected ligthing from the left would''ve helped lighten up the dark shadows.  Overall a good entry :)</td>', 'Challenge met.  I like how you saturated everything but red and then repeated the red in the border.  Works well.  The flowers look a little sad, maybe that''s because they are dried (?) or just because they are lying down.  The teddy with the heart and bow-tie and red nose is just too cute.  A little reflected ligthing from the left would''ve helped lighten up the dark shadows.  Overall a good entry :)', '2003-02-20 12:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(219997, 12466, 4648, '<td valign="top">Love the shot but wish it didn''t have so many shadows.  I can''t tell if that is long hair from the person in front or a shadow on the lady in back.  At first look I thought it was two women of different cultures.  Then as I looked at the face qualities I wasn''t sure if the person in the front was a man or a woman.  I like the idea of the shadows just not so pronounced that I can''t tell where the hair ends and the shadow starts.  I hope you can understand.  I love the sepia tone.  Really nice one.  Just, for me, needs a little different execution.  Otherwise it would be a 10 in my book.</td>', 'Love the shot but wish it didn''t have so many shadows.  I can''t tell if that is long hair from the person in front or a shadow on the lady in back.  At first look I thought it was two women of different cultures.  Then as I looked at the face qualities I wasn''t sure if the person in the front was a man or a woman.  I like the idea of the shadows just not so pronounced that I can''t tell where the hair ends and the shadow starts.  I hope you can understand.  I love the sepia tone.  Really nice one.  Just, for me, needs a little different execution.  Otherwise it would be a 10 in my book.', '2003-02-20 13:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(220025, 12471, 1041, '<td valign="top">Challenge met.  Great use of the candy hearts!  I think you arranged them in a heartshaped format, but that''s not easily visible.  Instead, it looks like the pile of hearts is a little uneven.  Did you try a more traditional arrangement?  As for the technical quality, it is good, I like tha the ones at the bottom aren''t quite in focus, adds to the feeling of depth.  The red background and the border works well here.</td>', 'Challenge met.  Great use of the candy hearts!  I think you arranged them in a heartshaped format, but that''s not easily visible.  Instead, it looks like the pile of hearts is a little uneven.  Did you try a more traditional arrangement?  As for the technical quality, it is good, I like tha the ones at the bottom aren''t quite in focus, adds to the feeling of depth.  The red background and the border works well here.', '2003-02-20 14:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(220026, 12504, 1041, '<td valign="top">Challenge met.  Very nice present :)  And you''ve included my favorite flowers in the shot.  They are so pretty and last so long :)  I also think they go well with the lace, and make a nice contrast to the more predictable red rose.  The top of the petals is a little out of focus, I don''t know whether you were able to increase your DOF on your camera beyond what you already have, if yes, that would enhance the photo in my opinion.  I think I would also like to see the flowers more in the photo (add more stem), they look a little "off to the side" right now.  But these are all small things, overall a nice photo.</td>', 'Challenge met.  Very nice present :)  And you''ve included my favorite flowers in the shot.  They are so pretty and last so long :)  I also think they go well with the lace, and make a nice contrast to the more predictable red rose.  The top of the petals is a little out of focus, I don''t know whether you were able to increase your DOF on your camera beyond what you already have, if yes, that would enhance the photo in my opinion.  I think I would also like to see the flowers more in the photo (add more stem), they look a little "off to the side" right now.  But these are all small things, overall a nice photo.', '2003-02-20 14:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(220032, 12489, 1041, '<td valign="top">Hm.  Without the title, love is not something I would''ve thought of looking at your photo.  As a photo, I find it quite interesting, you can see all sorts of things in the lighter reflection.  The white hotspot is a little too bright though, especially since the whole rest of the photo is very muted.  Two more things, personally, I don''t like that light blue drop-shadow, especially since it doesn''t match anything that you have in your photo, and I feel the border should pick up on something in the photo, and I would like to see you using the whole 640px that are allowed for the longer side, your photo seems a bit small.</td>', 'Hm.  Without the title, love is not something I would''ve thought of looking at your photo.  As a photo, I find it quite interesting, you can see all sorts of things in the lighter reflection.  The white hotspot is a little too bright though, especially since the whole rest of the photo is very muted.  Two more things, personally, I don''t like that light blue drop-shadow, especially since it doesn''t match anything that you have in your photo, and I feel the border should pick up on something in the photo, and I would like to see you using the whole 640px that are allowed for the longer side, your photo seems a bit small.', '2003-02-20 15:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(220033, 12523, 1041, '<td valign="top">Challenge definitely met.  My initial reaction was that the feet aren''t quite sharp because they are moving and not relaxed, but the more I look at this the more I like it.  Format is great, and the toning is, too.  Overall, it''s just a bit grainy, but a good entry regardless.</td>', 'Challenge definitely met.  My initial reaction was that the feet aren''t quite sharp because they are moving and not relaxed, but the more I look at this the more I like it.  Format is great, and the toning is, too.  Overall, it''s just a bit grainy, but a good entry regardless.', '2003-02-20 15:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(220036, 12454, 1041, '<td valign="top">Hi Lisa! :) (at least I''m pretty sure this is you).  Great photo.  I like the composition and crop very much, the way her lips are pressed against his hand which in turn is larger and curved around her hand.  I personally would like to see this in b&amp;w rather than toned and with a little less grain, but I have a feeling you did this deliberately, it''s more your style.  Regardless, I like this one a lot.</td>', 'Hi Lisa! :) (at least I''m pretty sure this is you).  Great photo.  I like the composition and crop very much, the way her lips are pressed against his hand which in turn is larger and curved around her hand.  I personally would like to see this in b&w rather than toned and with a little less grain, but I have a feeling you did this deliberately, it''s more your style.  Regardless, I like this one a lot.', '2003-02-20 15:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(220084, 12532, 1041, '<td valign="top">Challenge met, I guess, although I''ve seen stronger associations ... w/out the title I wouldn''t necessarily think of love.  I like unusual flower shots and b&amp;w is unusual, so points for creativity.  I like that some of the texture of the rose petals is visible.  The stem and leaves look very pale, I would expect them to be darker but maybe you just used a dark rose.  That does give this photo a little unreal feeling though.  Your lighting is uneven, even if there aren''t any glaring hotspots.  I''d love to see a little more on the bottom of the rose and the stem, too.</td>', 'Challenge met, I guess, although I''ve seen stronger associations ... w/out the title I wouldn''t necessarily think of love.  I like unusual flower shots and b&w is unusual, so points for creativity.  I like that some of the texture of the rose petals is visible.  The stem and leaves look very pale, I would expect them to be darker but maybe you just used a dark rose.  That does give this photo a little unreal feeling though.  Your lighting is uneven, even if there aren''t any glaring hotspots.  I''d love to see a little more on the bottom of the rose and the stem, too.', '2003-02-20 17:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(220085, 12522, 1041, '<td valign="top">Challenge met.  Two cute hearts, I like how they are leaning towards each other.  The strong lighting, creating those red shadows works very well here, especially since you didn''t get glaring hotspots on the hearts, just nice little highlights (I bet that was tough!).  I don''t usually like pink and red, but they go together well here.  A black border works well, too, I would probably remove the white altogether (nothing in your photo is white, so that part doesn''t tie in well) or replace it with a thin red border to match the hearts.  Nice photo.  :)</td>', 'Challenge met.  Two cute hearts, I like how they are leaning towards each other.  The strong lighting, creating those red shadows works very well here, especially since you didn''t get glaring hotspots on the hearts, just nice little highlights (I bet that was tough!).  I don''t usually like pink and red, but they go together well here.  A black border works well, too, I would probably remove the white altogether (nothing in your photo is white, so that part doesn''t tie in well) or replace it with a thin red border to match the hearts.  Nice photo.  :)', '2003-02-20 17:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(220088, 12488, 5865, '<td valign="top">The girl''s smile is absolutely fantastic.  I love it.  The lighting seems a little bit too harsh.  The spot on the forehead looks a little ugly and the eyes and mouth are in shadow.  However, I like the overall image.</td>', 'The girl''s smile is absolutely fantastic.  I love it.  The lighting seems a little bit too harsh.  The spot on the forehead looks a little ugly and the eyes and mouth are in shadow.  However, I like the overall image.', '2003-02-20 17:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(220118, 12454, 5728, '<td valign="top">Great photo Lisae!</td>', 'Great photo Lisae!', '2003-02-20 18:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(220140, 12519, 5475, '<td valign="top">Very simple,  very nice!  One of my favorites for this challenge.  Reminds me when I went to boot camp in 1983...  My girlfriend snet me letters sealed with a kiss!  8</td>', 'Very simple,  very nice!  One of my favorites for this challenge.  Reminds me when I went to boot camp in 1983...  My girlfriend snet me letters sealed with a kiss!  8', '2003-02-20 19:54:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(220192, 12429, 3730, '<td valign="top">One of my favorite compositions for this challenge...nicely done...I think it would work best with a solid white background, though</td>', 'One of my favorite compositions for this challenge...nicely done...I think it would work best with a solid white background, though', '2003-02-20 21:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(220193, 12527, 3730, '<td valign="top">Simply gorgeous, composition is great, colors are very nice....wish the diamond was a bit more in focus.</td>', 'Simply gorgeous, composition is great, colors are very nice....wish the diamond was a bit more in focus.', '2003-02-20 21:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(220196, 12468, 3730, '<td valign="top">Great unique idea. the composition works very nice...good luck :)</td>', 'Great unique idea. the composition works very nice...good luck :)', '2003-02-20 21:17:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(220198, 12481, 3730, '<td valign="top">haha, this is hilarious...and nicely photographed too. The lighting could be a bit better, and maybe the white balance is off a tad...still a nice shot :)</td>', 'haha, this is hilarious...and nicely photographed too. The lighting could be a bit better, and maybe the white balance is off a tad...still a nice shot :)', '2003-02-20 21:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(220202, 12495, 3730, '<td valign="top">Very professional looking shot...i don''t care much for the background, especially the big chunk of snow on the bottom left, but still a nice photograph...good luck :)</td>', 'Very professional looking shot...i don''t care much for the background, especially the big chunk of snow on the bottom left, but still a nice photograph...good luck :)', '2003-02-20 21:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(220204, 12489, 3730, '<td valign="top">hmmm, don''t really know what I''m looking at, and can''t quite get the LOVE out of this...sorry dude / dudette :(</td>', 'hmmm, don''t really know what I''m looking at, and can''t quite get the LOVE out of this...sorry dude / dudette :(', '2003-02-20 21:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(220205, 12482, 3730, '<td valign="top">Very cute kid, but the focus is off, the background/surroundings are way too busy and distracting, a bit over exposed. Composition is very good in terms of subject placement.</td>', 'Very cute kid, but the focus is off, the background/surroundings are way too busy and distracting, a bit over exposed. Composition is very good in terms of subject placement.', '2003-02-20 21:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(220206, 12485, 3730, '<td valign="top">very nice shot. a bit dark and the basket is a tad off-centered, bringing a bit of tension to the shot. Good luck</td>', 'very nice shot. a bit dark and the basket is a tad off-centered, bringing a bit of tension to the shot. Good luck', '2003-02-20 21:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(220221, 12468, 1379, '<td valign="top">I am inspired.  What a lovely photo.</td>', 'I am inspired.  What a lovely photo.', '2003-02-20 21:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(220294, 12495, 3280, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the win!  My favorite of the week!</td>', 'Congrats on the win!  My favorite of the week!', '2003-02-21 00:01:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(220296, 12527, 3280, '<td valign="top">Great shot and a well deserved ribbon!!</td>', 'Great shot and a well deserved ribbon!!', '2003-02-21 00:05:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(220302, 12550, 1880, '<td valign="top">Doug,<br/> <br/>Good job on an image well done.  This was my favorite for the week.<br/> <br/>Bob<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-02-21 00:21:59.</i></td>', 'Doug, Good job on an image well done.  This was my favorite for the week. Bob', '2003-02-21 00:21:14.000000', '2003-02-21 00:21:59.000000', 0),
(220303, 12469, 3730, '<td valign="top">Hey Ben, don''t you wish you could have spot-edited this one??  ;)<br/> <br/>edit-&gt; and just for fun, if you could spot-edit, what would you have done? Maybe you can do it and post it up somewhere...PM me and let me know.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-02-21 00:23:53.</i></td>', 'Hey Ben, don''t you wish you could have spot-edited this one??  ;) edit-> and just for fun, if you could spot-edit, what would you have done? Maybe you can do it and post it up somewhere...PM me and let me know.', '2003-02-21 00:22:55.000000', '2003-02-21 00:23:53.000000', 0),
(220308, 12495, 2700, '<td valign="top">Wow I am suprised... I accually picked the winner :)</td>', 'Wow I am suprised... I accually picked the winner :)', '2003-02-21 00:38:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(220309, 12495, 714, '<td valign="top">Congrats Jeremy.  Great photo!!!!  I love the dof here and wow what a perfect background.</td>', 'Congrats Jeremy.  Great photo!!!!  I love the dof here and wow what a perfect background.', '2003-02-21 00:43:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(220310, 12527, 714, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot!!  Congrats!!</td>', 'Very nice shot!!  Congrats!!', '2003-02-21 00:45:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(220311, 12435, 714, '<td valign="top">congrats! I love the textures and colors.</td>', 'congrats! I love the textures and colors.', '2003-02-21 00:46:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(220312, 12457, 714, '<td valign="top">All right Carsten 8th place.  Nice photo!</td>', 'All right Carsten 8th place.  Nice photo!', '2003-02-21 00:48:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(220314, 12454, 1037, '<td valign="top">How did you all know....? :P<br/> <br/>Actually, the sad thing about this photo is that only a few days later, we''ve decided we''re going to split up. But it''s OK, we''re still friends.</td>', 'How did you all know....? :P Actually, the sad thing about this photo is that only a few days later, we''ve decided we''re going to split up. But it''s OK, we''re still friends.', '2003-02-21 01:02:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(220315, 12527, 51167, '<td valign="top">Great shot Dave, This was my favorite shot for the week.  The lighting is perfect.  Very heartfelt.  Thanks for sharing.</td>', 'Great shot Dave, This was my favorite shot for the week.  The lighting is perfect.  Very heartfelt.  Thanks for sharing.', '2003-02-21 01:02:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(220321, 12435, 6172, '<td valign="top">I think the negative comments made during the challenge were undeserved, this is a great shot.  If I could have voted I would have given it a 9, and I like it better than the ones that placed above it.</td>', 'I think the negative comments made during the challenge were undeserved, this is a great shot.  If I could have voted I would have given it a 9, and I like it better than the ones that placed above it.', '2003-02-21 01:31:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(220355, 12495, 4162, '<td valign="top">Congrats! A very beautiful picture.</td>', 'Congrats! A very beautiful picture.', '2003-02-21 03:14:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(220361, 12527, 3585, '<td valign="top">That is a nicely composed image, congratulations.</td>', 'That is a nicely composed image, congratulations.', '2003-02-21 03:17:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(220372, 12470, 4162, '<td valign="top">Whats this doing all the way down here! I thought that it was really cool, very abstract  but excellent colours, composition and it''s original! You never can tell what is going to work with the voters!</td>', 'Whats this doing all the way down here! I thought that it was really cool, very abstract  but excellent colours, composition and it''s original! You never can tell what is going to work with the voters!', '2003-02-21 03:25:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(220387, 12495, 3585, '<td valign="top">congratulations, and continue exploring, good job.</td>', 'congratulations, and continue exploring, good job.', '2003-02-21 03:40:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(220394, 12435, 3585, '<td valign="top">This one was a real suprise to me, thanks to all, JJ</td>', 'This one was a real suprise to me, thanks to all, JJ', '2003-02-21 03:44:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(220399, 12519, 2716, '<td valign="top">Excellent one of my favorites this week.  Please give us the details of your entry.  Loved the high key effect.  Jacko.</td>', 'Excellent one of my favorites this week.  Please give us the details of your entry.  Loved the high key effect.  Jacko.', '2003-02-21 06:14:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(220400, 12514, 2716, '<td valign="top">This should have done better.  Very creative and very appropriately red.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-02-21 06:19:48.</i></td>', 'This should have done better.  Very creative and very appropriately red.', '2003-02-21 06:19:23.000000', '2003-02-21 06:19:48.000000', 0),
(220401, 12511, 2716, '<td valign="top">Wow should have done better.  Very humorous.  Too many 4 to 1s alao.  Good job.  Double exposure?  That is amazing.  Good job.</td>', 'Wow should have done better.  Very humorous.  Too many 4 to 1s alao.  Good job.  Double exposure?  That is amazing.  Good job.', '2003-02-21 06:21:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(220403, 12455, 2716, '<td valign="top">Alright, your first submission.  Nowhere to go but up.  <br/> <br/>Just remember that folks here really hate pictures that are out of focus.  And don''t forget to look at your picture objectively (forget about what you know about the picutre, look at it like you just stumbled upon it and have 3 second to make a choice to vote it between 1 and 10).  <br/> <br/>Good luck in the future challenges, and thanks for you first entry. <br/></td>', 'Alright, your first submission.  Nowhere to go but up.   Just remember that folks here really hate pictures that are out of focus.  And don''t forget to look at your picture objectively (forget about what you know about the picutre, look at it like you just stumbled upon it and have 3 second to make a choice to vote it between 1 and 10).   Good luck in the future challenges, and thanks for you first entry. ', '2003-02-21 06:29:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(220419, 12523, 4482, '<td valign="top">5th!!! Man!! C''était mon top, ma numéro uno! :-D<br/> <br/>Congrats on yet another top 10 mon cher!</td>', '5th!!! Man!! C''était mon top, ma numéro uno! :-D Congrats on yet another top 10 mon cher!', '2003-02-21 08:10:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(220430, 12495, 772, '<td valign="top">congrats on your first ribbon :)  well deserved... great shot :)</td>', 'congrats on your first ribbon :)  well deserved... great shot :)', '2003-02-21 08:18:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(220441, 12523, 4411, '<td valign="top">Excellent, well done Jacko! &lt;giggle&gt;</td>', 'Excellent, well done Jacko! <giggle>', '2003-02-21 08:33:49.000000', NULL, 0),
