(220555, 12495, 51167, '<td valign="top">wow, this is awesome feeling.  This was a fun challenge to shoot.  I went to the Salt Lake Temple because I figured a wedding would be a good "Love" theme.  Being Valentines day, there are probably 100 weddings there a day, so I figured I''d get some good ones.  It was a fun day to be shooting.</td>', 'wow, this is awesome feeling.  This was a fun challenge to shoot.  I went to the Salt Lake Temple because I figured a wedding would be a good "Love" theme.  Being Valentines day, there are probably 100 weddings there a day, so I figured I''d get some good ones.  It was a fun day to be shooting.', '2003-02-21 12:58:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(220567, 12495, 3032, '<td valign="top">I think this is one of those intimate moments a photographer should be shooting instead of the formal stiff portraits. This shows great emotion. It makes a very big impact on the viewer. I get the idea that the guy is about to kiss her on the head.<br/> <br/>The background is wonderful for this btw. In real life (outside dpc I would edit the ugly chunck of ice away.<br/> <br/>And compliments for that wedding dress.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-02-21 13:55:28.</i></td>', 'I think this is one of those intimate moments a photographer should be shooting instead of the formal stiff portraits. This shows great emotion. It makes a very big impact on the viewer. I get the idea that the guy is about to kiss her on the head. The background is wonderful for this btw. In real life (outside dpc I would edit the ugly chunck of ice away. And compliments for that wedding dress.', '2003-02-21 13:23:17.000000', '2003-02-21 13:55:28.000000', 0),
(220574, 12523, 5044, '<td valign="top">You were robbed. I thought you were adding to your collection of ribbons for sure. (I had a thought it was you). Great shot! Keep up the awesome work.</td>', 'You were robbed. I thought you were adding to your collection of ribbons for sure. (I had a thought it was you). Great shot! Keep up the awesome work.', '2003-02-21 13:46:48.000000', NULL, 0),
