(220592, 12435, 5418, '<td valign="top">I wasn''t able to vote on this, but it''s a great picture. The roses seem a bit fuzzy compared to the fence, which is a tad distracting. I have that problem all the time though!</td>', 'I wasn''t able to vote on this, but it''s a great picture. The roses seem a bit fuzzy compared to the fence, which is a tad distracting. I have that problem all the time though!', '2003-02-21 14:39:58.000000', NULL, 0),
